	a linkml:SchemaDefinition ;
	rdfs:seeAlso "https://actions.github.io/buildtypes/workflow/v1"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/metadata-syntax"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/workflow-syntax"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://docs.github.com/en/rest/checks/runs"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/rules"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://lmodel.github.io/github-actions"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:note "GitHub's documentation is versionless, so the version is the date its pages were read. With the SchemaStore commit in source and the REST API version in the annotations, it says which state of GitHub the model renders; scripts/check_upstream_release.py reads the same three pins and reports when one moves. The release tags are the schema's own versions." , "github_actions_core imports only the LinkML types, the workflow and action modules import the core, the rules module imports the workflow module, and this file adds only the document root, so an importer can take one module." ;
